# PROJECT TITLE
Professional Pharmaceutical Distribution Management System (PDMS)

## 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Develop a complete, professional, modern, secure, scalable, and enterprise-level Pharmaceutical Distribution Management System (PDMS) specifically designed for pharmaceutical distributors operating in Pakistan.

The system will be used by distribution managers, owners, accountants, sales managers, sales representatives, warehouse managers, storekeepers, recovery officers, and administrative staff.

A single distribution business may distribute pharmaceutical products belonging to multiple pharmaceutical companies simultaneously.

Examples of pharmaceutical companies include:

1. Getz Pharma
2. Sami Pharmaceuticals
3. CCL Pharmaceuticals
4. Indus Pharma
5. Hilton Pharma
6. Highnoon Laboratories
7. Martin Dow
8. AGP Limited
9. Abbott Laboratories
10. The Searle Company
11. GSK Pakistan
12. Ferozsons Laboratories
13. Barrett Hodgson
14. Bosch Pharmaceuticals
15. Other pharmaceutical manufacturers.

The software must support unlimited pharmaceutical companies, unlimited products, multiple warehouses, multiple sales territories, multiple sales representatives, and multiple financial accounts.

The system must maintain completely separate company-wise product records, stock records, purchase records, sales records, profitability, commissions, claims, balances, and financial reports while also providing consolidated distribution-level reports.

The software should be suitable for small, medium, and large pharmaceutical distribution businesses in Pakistan.

## 2. CORE SOFTWARE OBJECTIVES

The software must provide:

- Complete distribution business management.
- Multi-pharmaceutical-company management.
- Multi-warehouse inventory management.
- Batch-wise and expiry-wise stock tracking.
- Purchase and stock receiving management.
- Sales and distribution management.
- Retailer and customer management.
- Company-wise payable and receivable accounts.
- Cash and bank management.
- Sales representative management.
- Recovery and credit control.
- Expiry and near-expiry management.
- Damaged and expired stock management.
- Company claims and credit notes.
- Discounts, bonuses, schemes, and promotional offers.
- Commission and incentive management.
- Payroll and employee management.
- Expense and income management.
- Comprehensive financial accounting.
- Real-time dashboards.
- Advanced business intelligence.
- Complete reporting and analytics.
- Secure data storage and automated backups.
- Audit trails and user activity monitoring.

All modules must be interconnected. Data entered in one module should automatically update all relevant modules without duplicate manual entries.

